                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Honestly I can't recommend this game, you can take a look at my FIRST LOOK video and decide yourself and hear and see in detail why I wouldn't recommend it - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M732_FqWUAU\n\nTo put it together in short, at this stage game is just ... horrible. Graphics look unfinished / weird. Sound effects are total joke. also no servers / players. Animation are also a joke.\n\nGameplay itself is well, survival / building / crafting, which is all cool, but it's just old news. There are so many games that are in same price range and are already finished and have everything that this game has. Rust is one of them, also 7 Days to Die is similar and works great, Rust costs bit more on steam, but it has everything that W.A.R. has and then some.\n\nThis game needs to have something unique that does not exist in any other game, to attract players, but first I think graphics, sounds and animations need a serious overhaul. I know it's beta / early access, but it's no excuse and this review is regarding the current state of the game, not what it MAY become in 5+ years.\n\nPerhaps this game has small developer team, but people just need to STOP and think, I'd rather see 10 small dev teams come together and make 1 good game, rather than seeing 10 nearly unplayable games that most likely will never be finished.",
